  "deanInfo": {
    "name": "Dr. Sanjay Rathod",
    "qualification": "M.B.B.S - 1988, M.S. Anatomy - 1997",
    "designation": "Dean",
    "message": "It is my pleasure and a great honour in being able to serve the society from this position. This Institute and the hospital has treated, healed and positively impacted millions of lives over the past decades and we will endeavour to sustain and enhance the patient care and healthcare delivery to many more. Our commitment to excellence in medical education, research, and patient care continues to drive us forward as one of the premier medical institutions in Maharashtra."
